New performance profiling and diagnostic counters are available for Blazor WebAssembly apps. For more information, see the following articles:

*   [ASP.NET Core Blazor WebAssembly browser developer tools diagnostics](../blazor/performance/webassembly-browser-developer-tools-diagnostics?view=aspnetcore-10.0)
